OL,3,AMissing 11-month-old baby rescued after
OL,4,Abeing buried alive in a crate in South
OL,5,ACarolina
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn 11-month-old baby has been rescued
OL,8,Fin South Carolina after officials say
OL,9,Fhe was buried alive in a crate by his
OL,10,Ffather.
OL,12,FKoah Sharpe had been missing since
OL,13,FMonday when he was taken by his father,
OL,14,FMichael Comer, 25, according to the
OL,15,FLexington County Sheriff's Department.
OL,16,FComer was arrested on a burglary charge
OL,17,Fon Monday evening but his son was not
OL,18,Fwith him.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
