OL,3,AMissing 11-month-old baby rescued after
OL,4,Abeing buried alive in a crate in South
OL,5,ACarolina
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe baby was found on Tuesday "buried
OL,8,Falive" and "clinging to life" not far
OL,9,Ffrom his father's house, Lexington
OL,10,FCounty Sheriff Jay Koon said at a news
OL,11,Fconference. It is thought he had been
OL,12,Fthere for 24 hours.
OL,14,FThe child is now in hospital receiving
OL,15,Fcare, Koon said, adding he was hopeful
OL,16,Fhe would make a full recovery.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
